# Experiment A: Hadoop and Spark baseline at minimum EMR capacity, tier S (Phase 15, Wave 1).
# UNAPPROVED and UNEXECUTED. Used only if the A audit verdict is RE-RUN (see
# experiments/a-baseline/README.md); if the verdict becomes REUSE this manifest is not run.
# Format: scripts/README.md, "Experiment manifest contract". No spaces in values.
# PLACEHOLDERS the human replaces before an approval record is written
# (the record binds the sha256 of the final file, so any edit needs a new record):
#   ACCOUNT_ID       123456789012 is the documented example, not a real account.
#   (DATASET_SNAPSHOT is filled: scholarchain-s-20261107-10dd7f34121b, reported by WO-4 and
#                    verified by the human.)
#   OUTPUT_ROOT      /abs/outside/repo/... is a placeholder path; pick a durable directory
#                    outside the repository.
# Limits (tier S caps of decision P15-1: 90 min, 64 clients, 20000 tasks; all below them):
#   MAX_MINUTES 75   S run 6 took about 58 min up to the end of the EMR stages; the pipeline
#                    script inside the entry point stops at 70 min (experiments/a-baseline/run.sh).
#   MAX_CONCURRENCY 1, MAX_TASKS 1: the entry point starts exactly one pipeline execution. The
#                    unit of MAX_TASKS here is one start-execution; the script cannot enforce it.
# Cost basis: HOURLY_BURN_USD 0.60 is the tier S session burn in scripts/README.md,
# "Pipeline sizes" (UNVERIFIED rates, from COST_ESTIMATE.md). 0.60 x 75 min / 60 = 0.75.
# Needs the tier S overlay with the cluster as one primary node (core 0, no managed scaling)
# and no Neptune or Bedrock (the loader command is a no-op). See experiments/a-baseline/README.md.
MANIFEST_VERSION=1
EXPERIMENT_ID=A
DESCRIPTION=hadoop-spark-baseline-minimum-emr-capacity-tier-s-rerun
ENVIRONMENT=course
REGION=us-east-2
ACCOUNT_ID=123456789012
DATASET_SNAPSHOT=scholarchain-s-20261107-10dd7f34121b
SIZE_TIER=S
MAX_MINUTES=75
MAX_CONCURRENCY=1
MAX_TASKS=1
SPEND_CEILING_USD=0.75
HOURLY_BURN_USD=0.60
STOP_CONDITIONS=wall-clock,first-failure,spend-estimate
METRIC_NAMES=ExecutionTime,ExecutionsFailed,ExecutionsTimedOut,IsIdle,AppsRunning,AppsCompleted,AppsFailed,ContainerAllocated,TotalNodesRunning,YARNMemoryAvailablePercentage
METRIC_NAMESPACES=AWS/States,AWS/ElasticMapReduce
OUTPUT_ROOT=/abs/outside/repo/scholarchain-experiments
ENTRY_POINT=script:experiments/a-baseline/run.sh
